---
import { ArrowRight } from '@phosphor-icons/react';
---

<section aria-labelledby="problem-h" class="border-b border-line bg-bg">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:py-28">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-accent uppercase">01 · Problem</p>
    <h2 id="problem-h" class="mt-3 max-w-[22ch] font-display text-3xl leading-[1.2] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
      每个 AI 用户都在以同样的方式浪费额度
    </h2>

    <ol class="mt-10 flex max-w-4xl flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5" aria-label="浪费循环">
      {['写个模糊的提示', '得到错误的输出', '重新提问', '稍微接近', '再问一次', '第 4 次才拿到你要的东西'].map((step, i) => (
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm whitespace-nowrap text-muted">{step}</span>
          {i < 5 && <ArrowRight size={14} className="shrink-0 text-faint" aria-hidden="true" />}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20">
      <figure class="reveal">
        <span class="font-display text-6xl leading-none font-bold text-accent" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
        <blockquote class="mt-2 max-w-[17em] font-display text-2xl leading-[1.35] font-bold tracking-tight text-balance text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] md:leading-[1.25]">
          最好的提示词不是最长的那个，而是每一个词都在承担作用的。
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-5 max-w-[46ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
          大多数提示词生成器只会让提示更长。这项技能是让提示更锋利。
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="reveal flex flex-col justify-center gap-8 border-t border-line pt-10 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:pt-0 lg:pl-16">
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-accent md:text-6xl">
            3<span class="ml-2 text-xl font-semibold text-muted md:text-2xl">次</span>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2.5 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            被浪费的调用，只因为第一个提示写模糊了
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-accent md:text-6xl">
            ×50<span class="ml-2 text-xl font-semibold text-muted md:text-2xl">每天</span>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2.5 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            每日提示量，把浪费放大成流走的金钱和时间
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
